---
import '../styles/workspace.css';

const workstreams = [
  { id: 'WS-042', title: 'Municipal AI Act gap analysis', meta: 'Review · updated 4m ago', state: 'Needs decision', tone: 'attention' },
  { id: 'WS-039', title: 'Provider portability review', meta: 'Running · updated 12m ago', state: 'Running', tone: 'running' },
  { id: 'WS-031', title: 'Evidence retention policy', meta: 'Complete · updated yesterday', state: 'Ready', tone: 'ready' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Explore the Cortxt Workspace with demonstration data." />
    <title>Workspace preview | Cortxt</title>
    <script src="/landing-theme.js" is:inline></script>
    <style>[hidden]{display:none!important}.detail-drawer{gap:.75rem!important;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke)!important;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;background:var(--surface)!important}.detail-drawer>div{border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:8px}</style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="workspace-shell">
      <aside class="workspace-sidebar">
        <a class="workspace-brand" href="/" aria-label="Back to Cortxt home"><span>C</span><strong>Cortxt</strong></a>
        <nav aria-label="Workspace navigation">
          <button class="nav-item active" type="button" data-view="work"><span aria-hidden="true">◫</span>Work</button>
          <button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="decisions"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Decisions <b>2</b></button>
          <button class="nav-item" type="button" data-view="evidence"><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span>Evidence</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-bottom">
          <a href="/docs/">Documentation <span>↗</span></a>
          <a href="/widgets/">Widget Studio <span>↗</span></a>
          <div class="preview-note"><i></i><span><b>Preview workspace</b>Demonstration data only</span></div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <main class="workspace-main">
        <header class="workspace-header">
          <div><span class="mobile-mark">C</span><strong>Workspace</strong><span class="header-context">Operator view</span></div>
          <div class="header-actions"><button type="button" aria-label="Search workspace">⌘ K</button><a href="/">Exit preview</a></div>
        </header>

        <section class="workspace-content view active" data-panel="work">
          <div class="page-heading">
            <div><p>Good afternoon</p><h1>Review work. Keep control.</h1><p class="page-intro">Cortxt runs the work, preserves the proof, and stops when a human decision is required.</p></div>
            <span class="data-label">Demo data · read only</span>
          </div>

          <ol class="workspace-flow" aria-label="How the workspace works">
            <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Work runs</strong><small>Agents execute within a signed mandate.</small></div></li>
            <li><span>2</span><div><strong>Evidence collects</strong><small>Every result stays attributable and reviewable.</small></div></li>
            <li class="current"><span>3</span><div><strong>You decide</strong><small>Cortxt pauses at consequential boundaries.</small></div></li>
          </ol>

          <div class="attention-card">
            <div class="attention-copy"><span class="section-label">Current human decision · WS-042</span><h2>Accept the reviewed gap-analysis package?</h2><p>Cortxt stopped because accepting evidence is outside the run's authority. The mandate reserves this decision for you.</p></div>
            <div class="attention-actions"><button type="button" data-detail-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="evidence-detail">Inspect 12 evidence records</button><span>Guided demo · no external changes</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-drawer" id="evidence-detail" data-detail hidden>
            <div><span>Evidence coverage</span><strong>12 / 12</strong><small>47 applicable controls have cited sources.</small></div><div><span>Independent review</span><strong>Passed</strong><small>Checked by a separate policy-review role.</small></div><div><span>Policy exceptions</span><strong>None</strong><small>No unresolved scope or provider exceptions.</small></div>
            <details><summary>Inspect provenance and execution context</summary><p>Produced by Run 02 (Codex), replacing Run 01 (Hermes) after a provider-policy block. Both runs remain attributable to mandate M-042.</p></details>
            <section class="decision-consequences"><div><b>If you approve</b><span>The package becomes the accepted record and the Workstream advances to Complete.</span></div><div><b>If you return it</b><span>The Workstream stays paused and a new bounded Run addresses your note.</span></div></section>
            <div class="demo-actions"><button type="button" data-decision="returned">Return with note</button><button type="button" data-decision="approved">Approve package</button><small>This changes local demo state only.</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="decision-result" data-result hidden role="status"></div>

          <div class="workspace-grid">
            <section class="workstreams-panel">
              <div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="section-label">Workstream context</span><h2>Durable work</h2></div><span class="filter-button">Runs are execution details</span></div>
              <div class="workstream-list">
                {workstreams.map((item, index) => (
                  <button class:list={['workstream-row', { selected: index === 0 }]} type="button" data-workstream={item.id} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}>
                    <span class="workstream-id">{item.id}</span><span class="workstream-name"><strong>{item.title}</strong><small>{item.meta}</small></span><span class={`state ${item.tone}`}>{item.state}</span><span class="row-arrow">→</span>
                  </button>
                ))}
              </div>
            </section>

            <aside class="authority-panel">
              <div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="section-label">Selected workstream</span><h2>Authority</h2></div><span class="verified">● Verified</span></div>
              <dl><div><dt>Mandate</dt><dd>Signed</dd></div><div><dt>Owner</dt><dd>Human operated</dd></div><div><dt>Budget</dt><dd>$22.40 / $25</dd></div><div><dt>Execution</dt><dd>Run 02 · active</dd></div></dl>
              <div class="continuity"><span>Run 01<br /><b>Hermes · blocked</b></span><i></i><span>Run 02<br /><b>Codex · active</b></span></div>
              <p>Execution changed. The mandate and evidence trail persisted.</p><a class="studio-next" href="/widgets/">Build a governed view in Studio →</a>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="workspace-content view" data-panel="decisions" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p>Reserved for people</p><h1>Decisions.</h1></div><span class="data-label">2 waiting</span></div>
          <div class="simple-list"><article><span>Approval</span><h2>Approve reviewed evidence package</h2><p>WS-042 · Evidence complete · requested 4 minutes ago</p><button type="button" data-open-primary>Review</button></article><article><span>Policy</span><h2>Accept provider exception</h2><p>WS-039 · Evidence is still incomplete</p><button type="button" disabled>Waiting for evidence</button></article></div>
        </section>

        <section class="workspace-content view" data-panel="evidence" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p>Attributable by default</p><h1>Evidence.</h1></div><span class="data-label">24 records</span></div>
          <div class="simple-list"><article><span>WS-042 · Run 02</span><h2>Gap analysis evidence package</h2><p>12 records · Independently reviewed · Complete</p><button type="button" data-open-primary>Inspect</button></article><article><span>WS-031 · Run 04</span><h2>Retention policy verification</h2><p>8 records · Accepted yesterday</p><button type="button" disabled>Accepted record</button></article></div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
    <script is:inline>
      const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]');
      const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');
      const showView = (name) => {
        panels.forEach((panel) => {
          const active = panel.dataset.panel === name;
          panel.classList.toggle('active', active);
          panel.hidden = !active;
        });
      };
      navItems.forEach((item) => item.addEventListener('click', () => {
        navItems.forEach((entry) => entry.classList.toggle('active', entry === item));
        showView(item.dataset.view);
      }));
      const detailButton = document.querySelector('[data-detail-toggle]');
      const detail = document.querySelector('[data-detail]');
      detailButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        detail.hidden = !detail.hidden;
        detailButton.textContent = detail.hidden ? 'Inspect 12 evidence records' : 'Close evidence';
        detailButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!detail.hidden));
      });
      const openPrimary = () => { const workButton = document.querySelector('[data-view="work"]'); navItems.forEach((entry) => entry.classList.toggle('active', entry === workButton)); showView('work'); detail.hidden = false; detailButton.textContent = 'Close evidence'; detailButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true'); detail.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' }); };
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-primary]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', openPrimary));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-decision]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { const approved = button.dataset.decision === 'approved'; const result = document.querySelector('[data-result]'); result.hidden = false; result.className = `decision-result ${approved ? 'accepted' : 'returned'}`; result.innerHTML = approved ? '<b>Package accepted in this demo.</b><span>The Workstream would advance to Complete and preserve this package as its accepted record.</span>' : '<b>Package returned in this demo.</b><span>The Workstream would stay paused while a new bounded Run addresses your note.</span>'; document.querySelector('.demo-actions').hidden = true; }));
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-workstream]').forEach((row) => row.addEventListener('click', () => { document.querySelectorAll('[data-workstream]').forEach((entry) => { const selected = entry === row; entry.classList.toggle('selected', selected); entry.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(selected)); }); }));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
